<title>USA: BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 4 OF WORLD SERIES.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 4 OF WORLD SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the fourth game of</p>
<p>the World Series on Wednesday:</p>
<p> New York Yankees    8    ATLANTA BRAVES    6 (10 innings)</p>
<p>	 (Best-of-seven series tied 2-2)</p>
</text>
